# Playwright Prism Conventions

- Use JavaScript only; no TypeScript unless explicitly requested.
- UI specs live in `tests/ui/`; API specs in `tests/api/`.
- Page objects go in `pages/`; API helpers go in `api/`. Do not duplicate helpers across folders.
- Shared URLs and environment values live in `test-data/test-config.json` — do not hardcode base URLs in specs.
- Tag automated tests with `@Smoke` or `@regression` (assessment limit: 5–8 cases per manual/UI/API type).
- UI invoice flow requires pressing Confirm twice before invoice generation.
- Keep one Playwright config at repo root (`playwright.config.js`).
- Record meaningful AI prompts in `ai-prompts/` after each focused session.
